    *   **`<h1>`:** The main heading of the page.
    *   **`<div id="jokeDisplay">`:** This `div` is where the joke will be displayed. We give it an `id` so we can easily select it with JavaScript.
    *   **`<button id="getJokeBtn">`:** The button that the user will click. It also has an `id` for JavaScript selection.
    *   **`<script>`:** This section contains JavaScript code that makes the page interactive.
